OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_OdetteIntro::
	.string "Passengers aren't allowed\n"
	.string "forward of this cabin.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_OdetteDefeat::
	.string "...I'm not enforcing that\n"
	.string "anymore.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_OdettePostBattle::
	.string "Count the cabins on this deck.\n"
	.string "Then count the doors.\p"
	.string "They've never matched.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaIntro::
	.string "Did you hear the bell? It rings\n"
	.string "when someone comes aboard.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaDefeat::
	.string "It only rang once tonight.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaPostBattle::
	.string "Someone came aboard, and nobody\n"
	.string "went ashore. That's been true\l"
	.string "for every one of us.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_GriffIntro::
	.string "BOSUN GRIFF. Nobody boards my\n"
	.string "ship without a word from me.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_GriffDefeat::
	.string "You've had the word, then.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Rooms_1F_Text_GriffPostBattle::
	.string "The CAPTAIN's below, in the aft\n"
	.string "store. He hasn't come up since.\p"
	.string "Mind the flooded hold. The water\n"
	.string "in there isn't rain.$"
